        {
          "text": "Kĩndũ o na kĩva kya kĩla kĩumanĩe kĩikalũman’ye na kw’oko kwaku; nĩ kana Yeova aeke wai wa ũthatu wake, na ũkwon’ya tei, na ũkwĩw’ĩa ĩnee, na ũkwingĩvya, o tondũ wamevĩtĩe aaĩthe maku; ",
